{
 "about": [
  "The kernels' budget, a ratchet: any increase fails (the build: spv_budget over every module's SPIR-V; a run with",
  "ATLAS_PIPE_BUDGET=1 or strict: the driver's pipeline statistics). Lower a number when a change frees it; raise one",
  "only in a deliberate commit that says why. spv_budget <this file> native/build/gen --write prints today's spv part.",
  "spv: instructions, private (thread-private statics), workgroup (groupshared), fnArrays (function-scope arrays),",
  "structCalls (calls passing a struct or pointer, beyond structCallsOk). pipe: per vendor and pipeline name, registers,",
  "shared, local (bytes a thread, the statistic's low 32 bits), stack, binary (bytes). docs/AGENT-RULES.md has the why."
 ],
